{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":85,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"edccb9d4-09c9-4f0e-8d97-c6c55a3572ac","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230778847,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"技术支持工程师（日本）","OrgId":1729505,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、根据日本市场客户的自动化需求、以YOUIBOT AMR为核心，进行自动化解决方案的规格设计及提案；\n2、导入到实际项目现场前需要考虑的硬件、软件选型及规格确定；\n3、内部软件系统和客户软件系统的职责划分，确定接口规格和成本估算；\n4、终端客户，集成商，代理商的沟通交涉；\n5、关联文书的作成及管理（提案书、图纸、手册等）；\n6、根据项目管理，现地部署支援；\n7、项目推进过程中出现的问题，协调内外资源处理问题。","Require":"1、本科及以上，自动化、机械、电子类等相关专业；\n2、1年-3年以上自动化、物流相关工作经验(自动化解决方案设计、机械设计、电气设计、控制等）；\n3、商务级日语3，能够与客户和合作商顺畅沟通；\n4、2D/3D CAD图纸的阅读能力、2D/3D建模能力；\n5、针对客户的课题，具备可以准确、合理地提出解决方案所需要的相关知识和思维能力，并输出高质量的提案资料。\n【背景需要满足以下条件之一】\n使用AMR・AGV・机械臂进行自动化系统开发的集成商就职经验。\n1）拥有在搬运自动化行业担任售前工程师、项目经理的工作经验。\n2）自动化系统、自动化设备的设计开发经验者。\n3）从事过工厂自动化导入推进岗、生产技术岗、工厂工程师等岗位，有自动化导入、工艺设计、流程设计等经验。\n4）为人正直，有责任心；\n5）积极主动，有一定的内外协调能力。\n【具备以下条件者优先考虑】\n1）日系机器人厂家就职经验\n2）熟悉物流・汽车・半导体・电子・食品・药品・制造等行业的业务流程或者有相关行业从业经验。\n3）WMS/WCS/WES/MCS/MES等系统相关经验。\n4）机械相关的资格证书。\n5）英语读写听说良好。\n6）持有日本驾照。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-01-25T17:12:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"2c92e6b9-a71c-4c64-aaa6-b0bfeed01f78","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230778843,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"销售经理（Fab方向）","OrgId":1729523,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、确保完成辖区销售任务落地，广泛拜访客户；\n2、深拓既有客户,持续开发新客户直至获取订单；\n3、与内部技术团队进行有效沟通配合，与客户进行前期技术交流，保持商务联系；\n4、完成公司制定的销售目标；\n5、参加各类会展，挖掘跟踪意向客户，推广公司产品，提升公司品牌知名度。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、本科及以上学历，专业不限；\n2、5年及以上半导体或关联行业工作经验，有AGV/AMHS/工业自动化/集成商相关销售经验优先；\n3、有较强客户管理及商务谈判能力；\n4、良好职业形象，逻辑思维清晰，较强的沟通表达能力及抗压能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-01-25T17:06:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"45fd1c4b-b86f-48b4-aea2-941d6c08df73","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230778837,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"半导体解决方案总监","OrgId":1729455,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、负责半导体行业洁净车间生产物流自动化解决方案的规划与管理；\n2、主导大型半导体洁净室自动化物流项目的解决方案、技术交流与谈判等工作；\n3、负责半导体解决方案团队管理与培训工作；\n4、负责对外开展行业技术交流活动。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、本科及以上学历，微电子、工艺工程、自动化、机械工程、计算机与软件专业等；\n2、熟悉半导体生产工艺（衬底/晶圆制造/封测），熟悉AMHS/MCS系统，熟悉SEMI标准；\n3、十年以上半导体AMHS系统设计开发与解决方案经验，有移动机器人应用解决方案经验者优先；\n4、具备良好的团队管理能力与沟通能力；\n5、英语或日语熟练者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-01-25T16:41:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"22d81661-5b83-4f37-85ac-a3306c27bf29","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230773524,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级嵌入式软件工程师","OrgId":1729494,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.\t承担基于MCU的机器人运动控制及硬件控制的嵌入式软件开发工作；\n2.\t领导嵌入式软件团队，制定开发计划并确保项目按时交付；\n3.\t与硬件、产品设计团队紧密合作，推动软硬件协同开发；\n4.\t监督软件架构设计、代码审查和质量保证工作；\n5.\t确保嵌入式系统的安全性、稳定性和性能优化；\n6.\t培养和指导团队成员，提升团队整体技术水平；\n7.\t管理团队资源，制定合理的任务分配和开发进度；\n8.\t协调与第三方供应商及合作伙伴的技术沟通，确保软件集成与兼容性。","Require":"1.\t本科及以上学历，计算机科学、电子工程、软件工程等相关专业；\n2.\t5年以上嵌入式系统开发经验，至少3年团队管理经验，拥有大厂、上市企业或中大型企业的丰富工作经历，并已至少成长至部门主管或更高级管理岗位；\n3.\t熟悉嵌入式实时操作系统；\n4.\t具备丰富的C语言编程经验，熟悉MCU程序开发；\n5.\t深入理解工控、机器人设备技术，包括传感器、总线通信（CAN、485等）、网络通信；\n6.\t良好的问题解决能力和逻辑思维，能够处理复杂的技术问题；\n7.\t优秀的沟通能力，能够有效推动跨部门协作；\n8.\t年龄不超过40岁。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-12-28T18:39:16","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"37988c46-22d4-4716-89cc-eb63174b6361","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230773518,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"销售经理/高级销售经理","OrgId":1729505,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1，根据公司日本市场的年度目标及销售策略，负责销售任务，进行销售预测，达成销售指标；\n2，有独立开发市场的能力，能够挖掘跟踪意向客户，进行渠道开发和渠道甄别，协助建立和维护销售网络；\n3，维护客户关系，挖掘客户潜力，积极应对问询，主导线索商机订单的转化，及时有效地联合公司内部团队解决客户需求；\n4，执行日本市场需求及动态的收集和分析，积极反馈，能形成阶段性市场分析报告；\n5，进行展会支持和广告投放等工作，通过活动举办和产品推广，不断提升公司的品牌知名度；\n6、订单商洽及跟单工作，确保订单按照客户要求及时完成，包括合同、客户沟通及内部流程对应；\n7，市场文件制和优化。","Require":"1、大学本科，机械自动化专业优先考虑；\n2，5~15年工作经验优先，BtoB销售经验者；\n3，日系机器人厂家，机器人及自动化行业相关工作岗位经验者；\n4，熟悉日本商务文化，法规公约及惯例；\n5，踏实稳重，认真细心，积极乐观；\n6，具备较强的服务意识和亲和力，不断自我迭代、优化的意识；\n7，能够独立思考，具有良好的沟通协调能力，有高效处理事务的能力；\n8，日语可以作为工作语言；\n9 ，加分：英语沟通读写流利；中国语（北京语）初级。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-12-28T18:37:42","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null}],"Total":0}